{emailSubject}Password Recovery Request - {$username}{/emailSubject}
<h3>User {$username} has requested a password reset</h3>
<p>
    You can reset your password <a href="{$link}"><strong>by following this link</strong></a>.
    This link will allow you to change your password until {$expiresAfter}. After that, you will have to request a new link in the web application.
</p>
<hr>
<p>
    If you did not request a password reset in ReCodEx, please ignore this email.
</p>
